# Keep Linux line endings in every checkout, Windows included (GitHub
# Desktop would otherwise turn LF into CRLF), so a release built on any
# computer is byte-for-byte the same.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.xz binary
*.gz binary
*.wav binary
